    "description": {
      "value": "\n<h2>Charge Blade</h2>\n<p>A transforming martial weapon built around cycling between Sword Mode and Axe Mode,\nbuilding Charge, loading Phials, and spending those Phials on explosive attacks.</p>\n\n<h3>State Tracking</h3>\n<p>Until the one-click state-management macro is added, manually track:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Mode:</strong> Sword / Axe</li>\n<li><strong>Charge:</strong> 0-5</li>\n<li><strong>Phials:</strong> 0-5</li>\n<li><strong>Shield Charged:</strong> Yes / No</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Sword Mode</h3>\n<p><strong>Sword Slash:</strong> 1d8 slashing. Once per turn when you hit with Sword Slash,\ngain 1 Charge, to a maximum of 5. While in Sword Mode, the shield grants +2 AC.</p>\n\n<h3>Loading Phials</h3>\n<p>As a bonus action, convert Charge into Phials and reset Charge to 0:\n3-4 Charge becomes 3 Phials; 5 Charge becomes 5 Phials.</p>\n\n<h3>Axe Mode</h3>\n<p><strong>Axe Slash:</strong> 1d12 slashing.</p>\n<p><strong>Element Discharge:</strong> 1d12 slashing + 1d8 force; spend 1 Phial.</p>\n<p><strong>AED:</strong> 1d12 slashing + 3d8 force; spend 1 Phial and return to Sword Mode.</p>\n\n<h3>Charged Shield</h3>\n<p>As a bonus action, spend all loaded Phials to charge the shield for 1 minute per Phial spent.\nWhile charged, Sword Mode's shield bonus becomes +3 AC instead of +2, Axe attacks deal +1d4 phial\ndamage, and SAED becomes available.</p>\n\n<h3>SAED</h3><p><strong>Super Amped Element Discharge:</strong> 2d12 slashing plus 1d8 force per Phial spent. With Charge Blade Automation v2, the phial dice are rolled automatically from the stored Phial count.</p>\n<h3>Guard Point</h3>\n<p>Reaction when a visible creature hits you with a melee attack: gain +2 AC against that attack.\nIf the attack then misses, you may immediately transform. If the shield is charged, the attacker\ntakes 1d6 phial damage.</p>\n",
      "chat": "<p><strong>Charge Blade</strong></p>"
    },
